    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could personalize learning by adapting explanations to individual strengths/weaknesses. They could generate interactive problems or provide instant feedback, reducing anxiety for students like me who struggle with abstract concepts. My high agreeableness makes me value collaborative tools that support others’ growth."
